Subject: [PATCH 7/8] port: spawn every child directly on WASIX

WASIX has no fork, so refuse it with ENOSYS rather than reference an
unavailable symbol, and launch every postmaster child by posix_spawn
of the server's own binary, the EXEC_BACKEND path. initdb spawns its
bootstrap server the same way instead of through a shell, and
validate_exec accepts the mounted module, which is part of the same
immutable service package as the caller.

